WEBVTT

00:09.790 --> 00:10.780
We're here.

00:12.120 --> 00:13.750
Wow.

00:17.320 --> 00:20.240
City-State of Mamuta

00:20.400 --> 00:22.200
It's an immigration gate.

00:28.120 --> 00:31.430
Are you really going to start a fight here?

00:31.430 --> 00:32.200
Probably.

00:32.200 --> 00:34.000
Of course you are.

00:34.720 --> 00:41.470
B-But I bet a big city like this 
has lots of soldiers and weapons.

00:41.870 --> 00:43.260
What are you trying to say?

00:43.260 --> 00:46.690
Not even you would come out 
the other side unscathed.

00:50.160 --> 00:52.290
I know. Let's play rock-paper-scissors.

00:52.290 --> 00:54.150
What? Why?

00:54.150 --> 00:59.160
The loser has to do something 
for the winner. What do you say?

00:59.630 --> 01:00.580
Nah, I'm good.

01:02.960 --> 01:07.380
Apparently, it's a popular game 
in the streets. I bet it's fun.

01:07.380 --> 01:09.300
I've never heard of it, and I'm not playing.

01:10.600 --> 01:13.860
Here we go. First comes rock...

01:13.860 --> 01:15.050
I'm not playing.

01:15.050 --> 01:16.160
Rock, paper...

01:16.160 --> 01:16.800
I'm not playing.

01:17.420 --> 01:21.100
If you don't play, you lose. 
First comes rock...

01:35.760 --> 01:37.820
This place is run-down, too.

01:39.040 --> 01:43.170
What's left for me to do when everyone 
runs themselves into the ground?

01:44.460 --> 01:45.960
Adonis, up ahead.

01:46.700 --> 01:49.460
There's someone there. It's a woman.

03:35.620 --> 03:37.490
Hey...

03:37.490 --> 03:39.240
Don't let your guard down!

03:39.620 --> 03:42.990
I know, but she might not have much time.

03:44.990 --> 03:49.750
Did something happen 
to you? Are you injured?

03:50.300 --> 03:53.260
I must hurry.

03:55.320 --> 03:58.380
She's running from something.

03:59.420 --> 04:01.880
That's not a person! Get away from her!

04:04.920 --> 04:07.000
I must do it now.

04:05.180 --> 04:11.390
Body Type: Normal

04:05.430 --> 04:11.390
Flesh Elasticity: 41

04:05.680 --> 04:11.390
Hip: 87.6

04:06.470 --> 04:11.390
Bust: 83.7

04:06.640 --> 04:11.390
Waist: 59.8

04:07.220 --> 04:11.390
Sex: Female

04:07.340 --> 04:11.390
Projected Pleasure Index: 34. Low value.

04:12.200 --> 04:15.830
Anyone will do, so long 
as I experience pleasure...

04:16.140 --> 04:18.770
even if it's a woman!

04:42.420 --> 04:46.740
Feels... bad...

04:53.900 --> 04:55.440
It's a madoa.

04:57.080 --> 04:58.560
A mechanical doll.

05:00.940 --> 05:02.480
A mechanical doll?

05:04.880 --> 05:06.850
A plaything for humans.

05:22.830 --> 05:24.930
That's her voice.

05:24.930 --> 05:27.020
Which means there are more.

05:29.580 --> 05:32.380
I'll be right back. Stay here.

05:34.180 --> 05:36.560
W-Wait. I'll go with you.

05:37.180 --> 05:41.400
Listen, quit acting without my permission.

05:41.400 --> 05:44.070
If I tell you to stay here, then stay here.

05:44.070 --> 05:45.720
If you don't, I'll leave you behind.

05:47.400 --> 05:51.030
Shout if anything happens. Got it?

06:13.420 --> 06:14.930
Make love to me.

06:15.180 --> 06:17.190
Make love to me now.

06:32.010 --> 06:35.310
Written-Style Summoning Magic: Enlighten.

06:48.290 --> 06:49.930
<i>It's not what it looks like.</i>

06:49.930 --> 06:52.590
<i>I'm not doing this to make Adonis mad.</i>

06:52.590 --> 06:57.340
<i>I promised Mr. Punch that 
I'd keep him out of harm's way.</i>

06:57.850 --> 06:59.000
<i>It's all right.</i>

06:59.000 --> 07:02.350
<i>He wouldn't leave a girl 
behind in this abandoned city.</i>

07:02.660 --> 07:04.860
<i>Adonis isn't that kind of person.</i>

07:04.860 --> 07:06.620
<i>Even if he finds me...</i>

07:08.080 --> 07:11.320
I'm sorry. I was just so worried about you.

07:11.320 --> 07:13.940
Good grief. You're hopeless.

07:14.490 --> 07:17.010
<i>Yup, that's how it would go.</i>

07:18.420 --> 07:20.780
<i>Wait a minute...</i>

07:21.760 --> 07:25.080
I've decided I don't need you after all.

07:27.080 --> 07:30.070
<i>He left me behind before.</i>

07:31.620 --> 07:35.100
<i>N-No, that was my fault.</i>

07:35.100 --> 07:39.360
<i>Besides, it was his way of being kind
 by keeping me out of trouble.</i>

07:39.360 --> 07:41.370
<i>You know how he is, Doroka.</i>

07:41.370 --> 07:45.860
<i>Adonis is scary when he's mad, 
but he'd never actually hurt me.</i>

07:46.050 --> 07:47.690
Don't screw with me!

07:47.690 --> 07:49.240
Don't screw with me!

07:49.240 --> 07:51.760
All the witches are dead.

07:51.760 --> 07:56.010
Don't talk to me about witches, human scum.

07:57.280 --> 08:00.020
<i>He's actually hurt me quite a bit.</i>

08:01.700 --> 08:05.080
I told you not to follow me. I'll kill you.

08:05.080 --> 08:06.950
So violent!

08:06.950 --> 08:09.720
<i>"I'll leave you behind" 
turned into "I'll kill you"!</i>

08:10.010 --> 08:12.780
You don't take me seriously, do you?

08:13.170 --> 08:18.480
I thought you were an idiot, 
but are you doing this on purpose?

08:18.480 --> 08:20.960
I'm sorry, Adonis!

08:23.030 --> 08:31.000
But I thought about it, and I think 
it's safer for us to stick together.

08:31.000 --> 08:35.100
Besides, I'm carrying the bag 
with all our stuff.

08:35.100 --> 08:40.720
So it's more convenient to keep me around.

08:40.720 --> 08:42.870
Would you like some of this?

08:51.040 --> 08:53.500
I guess that makes sense.

08:55.640 --> 08:57.640
Do whatever you want.

08:57.910 --> 08:59.880
Just don't get in my way.

09:01.880 --> 09:03.480
I knew you were kind!

09:03.480 --> 09:04.890
Keep it down.

09:22.670 --> 09:25.670
This smell... It smells like death.

09:33.130 --> 09:35.180
Mamuta, the ruined kingdom.

09:35.400 --> 09:37.930
So this is what it means 
to be consumed by desire.

09:59.750 --> 10:02.520
I didn't know they made madoa like these.

10:02.840 --> 10:04.990
They're practically copies of humans.

10:07.210 --> 10:08.790
Made in Redia, huh?

10:15.440 --> 10:18.590
I wanted someone to love me.

10:20.680 --> 10:22.480
I wanted to be loved.

10:21.360 --> 10:22.480
Touch me.

10:22.480 --> 10:24.130
Caress me.

10:22.480 --> 10:24.140
Anyone will do.

10:27.620 --> 10:30.110
I'm sick of it.

10:33.290 --> 10:35.040
They have a sense of self?

10:35.040 --> 10:37.230
Why?

10:37.730 --> 10:41.220
Why were we made?

10:43.240 --> 10:47.000
Why were we programmed like this?

10:47.750 --> 10:53.000
We never asked for this life.

10:56.390 --> 10:59.250
Please.

11:13.290 --> 11:14.570
Thank you.

11:15.270 --> 11:17.930
Now... we are...

11:34.540 --> 11:37.000
Suzure Special Espionage Unit Kunoichi 
Kunoichi Crew #5

11:37.550 --> 11:40.260
Suzure Special Espionage Unit Kunoichi
 Kunoichi Crew #6

11:44.350 --> 11:48.020
Looks like Redian sentries, Five.

11:48.020 --> 11:51.070
They're all the way out here? What a pain.

11:51.070 --> 11:53.280
I agree. What should we do?

11:53.710 --> 11:56.670
Charge straight through, obviously.

11:57.500 --> 11:59.530
I thought you might say that.

12:00.090 --> 12:02.280
You get it, Six.

12:04.030 --> 12:06.030
Hey, you! Stop!

12:06.030 --> 12:07.540
Show us your identi—

12:24.550 --> 12:25.800
Bitch!

12:41.040 --> 12:42.440
Pathetic.

12:42.440 --> 12:44.460
Truly.

12:46.560 --> 12:52.530
Ophelia the witch said science 
revealed humankind's true nature.

12:55.830 --> 13:02.800
A world that can create any toy 
imaginable is bound to produce sex robots.

13:06.300 --> 13:12.230
It was inevitable that women who exist only 
to provide pleasure would be created.

13:13.400 --> 13:15.680
Humans are scum.

13:19.330 --> 13:22.310
You recognize this, don't you?

13:22.970 --> 13:27.180
Those manacles are from 
the Redian concentration camp.

13:27.650 --> 13:30.020
The slave trade.

13:30.020 --> 13:32.160
Despite how developed it was,

13:32.160 --> 13:38.670
it wasn't easy for this little nation to 
import so many sophisticated Redia sex robots.

13:39.050 --> 13:44.000
So you have to serve the people, too.

13:46.040 --> 13:51.940
They offered their own women in exchange 
for more sexually pleasing dolls.

13:52.260 --> 13:56.460
Mamuta probably exported 
all the women in their nation

13:56.760 --> 14:00.280
to the great Redia Empire.

14:01.550 --> 14:03.250
How awful.

14:07.990 --> 14:12.490
They let go of their wives and daughters

14:13.410 --> 14:15.650
so they could purchase sex robots.

14:18.300 --> 14:20.700
This is how humans are.

14:20.700 --> 14:24.380
They know no limits. It's disappointing.

14:24.380 --> 14:27.870
Then this nation fell into ruin because...

14:29.380 --> 14:33.180
Without women, the next 
generation can't be born.

14:34.160 --> 14:37.740
The men drown in pleasure and rot away.

14:37.740 --> 14:40.260
A nation like that can't last.

14:43.770 --> 14:49.650
This probably isn't the only 
nation that's fallen in this way.

14:50.350 --> 14:53.960
Gear Expansion, my ass. 
It makes me want to puke.

15:29.100 --> 15:31.960
Adonis, are you making something?

15:31.960 --> 15:35.440
An improvised EMP.

15:36.150 --> 15:38.210
An EM-what?

15:44.200 --> 15:46.340
I'm putting them to rest.

15:54.230 --> 15:58.960
You mean you're mercy killing them.

15:59.640 --> 16:01.610
Let's put an end to this.

16:07.920 --> 16:11.730
It won't hurt them, will it?

16:11.730 --> 16:15.090
No. They'll just feel a small shock.

16:21.960 --> 16:24.010
Hold up that loudspeaker.

16:24.440 --> 16:25.700
Okay.

16:28.810 --> 16:30.920
Written-Style Summoning Magic...

16:33.800 --> 16:35.120
Final Pulse.

16:35.090 --> 16:37.140
<b>Final Pulse</b>

17:04.920 --> 17:10.120
<i>Adonis, I'm so glad you're here with me.</i>

17:21.330 --> 17:23.570
So that's the wanted man from Redia?

17:23.570 --> 17:26.010
Yes, the witch's apprentice.

17:26.310 --> 17:29.060
He's just a kid. Is he a teenager?

17:29.060 --> 17:31.350
Don't underestimate him, sister.

17:31.880 --> 17:35.370
That rebel has given the Redia Empire
 considerable trouble.

17:35.370 --> 17:39.440
He attacked New Nightmare 
in retaliation for the witch hunts.

17:39.440 --> 17:41.790
After slaughtering numerous citizens,

17:41.790 --> 17:45.400
he even annihilated 
the elite force sent after him.

17:45.400 --> 17:50.370
I thought we weren't 
supposed to touch witch stuff.

17:50.370 --> 17:52.160
Officially, no.

17:52.160 --> 17:58.640
But Emperor Suzure instructed us to capture 
anything that might help keep Redia in check.

18:00.510 --> 18:02.640
I see.

18:03.100 --> 18:08.520
I suppose Emperor Suzure will 
reward us if we succeed here.

18:09.450 --> 18:13.360
Would we finally get to live in the capital?

18:14.550 --> 18:18.530
As long as I'm with you, I'll live anywhere.

18:20.130 --> 18:24.020
Then let's go take down this beast.

18:24.020 --> 18:25.010
Yes, sister.

18:25.770 --> 18:28.310
I'll deal with the woman.

18:28.310 --> 18:30.920
You capture the witch's apprentice.

18:30.920 --> 18:32.920
Who's the big sister here?

18:32.920 --> 18:34.280
You, of course.

18:40.520 --> 18:41.700
Pests.

19:03.240 --> 19:05.440
Who are you?

19:31.190 --> 19:35.240
I'm sorry this is all I can do for you.

19:35.230 --> 19:39.990
<b>Grave of the Madoa</b>

19:35.240 --> 19:39.150
May you rest in peace, madoa.

19:39.980 --> 19:42.300
Offering your condolences 
won't do them any good.

19:42.990 --> 19:49.100
Erecting graves and praying is 
simply a way for the living to cope.

19:49.100 --> 19:51.480
You know that, Doroka.

19:54.000 --> 19:59.040
If you want to honor the madoa, 
there's only one thing you should do.

19:59.040 --> 20:03.640
Give humans a taste of their resentment.

20:04.320 --> 20:07.270
I don't think that's right.

20:08.100 --> 20:11.640
Oh, yeah? Then we disagree.

20:16.150 --> 20:18.900
<b>Witches of Lunamilia</b>

20:19.990 --> 20:22.920
Why don't you stay here forever, then?

20:22.920 --> 20:25.160
You enjoy sniveling, don't you?

20:26.530 --> 20:28.790
Why would you say that?

20:28.790 --> 20:35.530
Anna, Ophelia, and the witches of Lunamilia 
were killed by the humans I lured to them.

20:35.790 --> 20:38.760
Your friends died because of me.

20:38.760 --> 20:41.040
Why would you travel with me?

20:42.520 --> 20:45.190
This is your last chance to reconsider.

20:46.320 --> 20:48.050
Look at these.

20:48.050 --> 20:51.310
Symbol of

20:48.050 --> 20:51.310
Reconciliation

20:48.760 --> 20:51.310
I thought I threw those away.

20:51.310 --> 20:56.320
I don't want to blame you, 
and I don't want to argue anymore.

20:57.690 --> 21:01.440
The witches were trying to use you.

21:01.920 --> 21:04.700
Our desire for magical items
 to use against humanity

21:04.700 --> 21:09.440
led us to abduct you, provoke you, 
and attempt to resurrect Chloe.

21:09.440 --> 21:12.980
What's that if not betrayal?

21:16.630 --> 21:17.720
Let's go.

21:19.210 --> 21:20.430
Sorry.

21:21.650 --> 21:22.680
It's okay.

21:24.750 --> 21:27.780
Now we've officially made up.

21:29.790 --> 21:32.810
Take those crappy dolls 
off your bag, though.

21:32.810 --> 21:33.970
They're lame.

21:33.970 --> 21:35.360
Shock!

21:35.360 --> 21:38.080
I'm pretty proud of these.

21:38.080 --> 21:39.400
It looks just like you.

21:39.400 --> 21:43.110
Hardly. Don't you have any other skills?

21:43.110 --> 21:45.910
Skills? Singing, maybe.

21:45.610 --> 21:47.110
<b>Motorcycle Trip For Two 
Song by Doroka</b>

21:47.110 --> 21:50.160
Please don't sing while I'm driving.

21:50.160 --> 21:51.750
Aw, what?

21:52.120 --> 21:55.620
C'mon, don't flirt with each other.

21:57.430 --> 22:01.130
You're making me jealous.

22:01.130 --> 22:04.120
Um... Who are you?

22:04.120 --> 22:05.940
He's clearly an enemy.

22:06.870 --> 22:09.510
<i>Crap. They've already found us.</i>

22:24.810 --> 22:29.240
Hey, there. I'm Shirousagi.

22:29.240 --> 22:32.010
I'm a pretty big deal in Redia.

22:32.830 --> 22:35.840
I'm here for your head.

22:36.120 --> 22:38.330
Redia, huh?

22:38.650 --> 22:41.440
Finally, someone I can kill.
